description: Tempra house rules (pointer to AGENTS.md and docs/ai)
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` first; `docs/ai/` is the source of truth (frontend, backend, governance, PR and CI). This rule file never overrides them.

- Svelte 5 runes only; values derived from props are `$derived`; game loops live in `onMount`.
- `isNullish` / `nonNullish` from `$lib/utils/nullish.utils`; imports through `$lib/...`.
- Every user-visible string goes through `t({ locale, key })` and into both catalogs under `src/lib/constants/messages/`.
- Gates: `npm run quality`, `npm run check`, `npm test`, `npm run e2e`, `npm run build`.
- PR title: Conventional Commit with scope. No AI attribution in commits or PRs. No em dashes in prose.
